<title>JAPAN: Hitachi, Toshiba tie in Asia nuclear plant project.</title>
<headline>Hitachi, Toshiba tie in Asia nuclear plant project.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hitachi Ltd and Toshiba Corp announced on Tuesday that they would jointly seek contracts for nuclear power plant projects in Asia by forming a a new organisation.</p>
<p>They will form Asia ABWR (Advanced Boiling Water Reactor) Promotion Organisation on January 1.</p>
<p>The two firms will jointly conduct feasibility studies and promote their boiling water reactors in Asian countries, they said.</p>
</text>
